    "Exclusive operation receipt read waits for a competing uncommitted original writer.",
    "Cancellation/interruption propagate with no new rows; peer account cannot read another actor receipt.",
    "Malformed descriptors cannot reach receipt lookup and corrupted receipt identity/revision cannot publish."
